The battery low LED pattern (pro1x-maemo-leste patches/fixes): mce's
battery module raises PatternBatteryLow while upower reports the warning
level, as the N900's never did (compiled out). The Pro1X's
mce.ini.d/50-pro1x.ini lists and defines it (a red flash with the display
off); with mce.ini's own list, which lacks it, nothing changes.

diff --git a/src/modules/battery-upower.c b/src/modules/battery-upower.c
--- a/src/modules/battery-upower.c
+++ b/src/modules/battery-upower.c
@@ -54,7 +54,7 @@
 #define UPDATE_DELAY 100
 
 /** Whether to support legacy pattery low led pattern; nonzero for yes */
-#define SUPPORT_BATTERY_LOW_LED_PATTERN 0
+#define SUPPORT_BATTERY_LOW_LED_PATTERN 1
 
 /** How long we want battery state to be forced after charger state changed */
 #define FORCE_STATE_TIME 10
